    "Connect the phone to the Mac and unlock it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Telefon mit dem Mac verbinden und entsperren."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将手机连接到 Mac 并解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected by cable? Right-click the phone → “Use Wi-Fi Instead of Cable”. Without a cable (Android 11 or later): Developer options → Wireless debugging → Pair device with pairing code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per Kabel verbunden? Rechtsklick auf das Telefon → «WLAN statt Kabel verwenden». Ohne Kabel (ab Android 11): Entwickleroptionen → Kabelloses Debugging → Gerät über einen Kopplungscode koppeln."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过数据线连接？右键单击手机 → “使用 Wi-Fi 代替数据线”。不使用数据线（Android 11 或更高版本）：开发者选项 → 无线调试 → 使用配对码配对设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected via Wi-Fi – you can unplug the cable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per WLAN verbunden – das Kabel kann ab"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过Wi-Fi连接 – 您可以拔下线缆"
